abstract: >-
  A spatio-temporal graph neural network baseline for weekly district-level
  dengue incidence in Sri Lanka (25 districts, 2013-2022), extended with three
  stackable contributions: an SEIR-SEI physics-informed loss, GAN-based data
  augmentation, and a learned adaptive graph.
